mapping

controller 1:
left joystick: move all directional
right joystick: turn robot (left-right only)
left trigger: intake while hold
left bumper: turn to 0 degrees direction (fast)
right bumper: slow moving mode while hold
B: park (disable all four driving motors while hold)
X: set to robot centric
Y: set to field centric
A: Emergency release

controller 2:
left joystick: up/down the hood
right joystick: left-right turn the turret manually
left trigger: autoaim and start the launcher motors while hold
left bumper: if autoaim is not on, start the launcher motors with the near position rpm
right bumper: if autoaim is not on, start the launcher motors with the far position rpm
right trigger: shoot
left arrow keys: left-right: increase/decrease the near position rpm. up-down: increase/decrease the far position rpm



TELEMETRY:
Line 1: Team colour
Line 2: LL ON/OFF | DISTANCE | FPS | TEMPERATURE | TAGS: Tags currently visible
Line 3: HOOD: Hood pitch| CRPM: Current RPM | NEAR | FAR | MANUAL | POLYNOMIAL
Line 4: TURRET: Encoder angle
Line 5: Robot pose via localisation 
